WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:03.300
Film Courage: So many independent filmmakers only get
a chance to make one feature film which

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:07.440
is so true usually they're tapped out
financially usually.  You've been

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.410
fortunate to do so many. What do you
attribute that to?

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:17.070
Filmmaker Richard Linklater: I don't know. Low budgets compel. I don't
know. I think it now's a good time to be

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:20.430
a filmmaker you know technology's
helping you can keep the budgets low and

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:26.910
get your films made you know that's good
but I think what's good about the

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:30.150
current media environment you really can
make a film and see if it's what you're

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:33.630
meant to be doing you know I always felt
really comfortable making films that's

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:38.670
how I think that's what I think about
that's who I am you know but writing a

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:42.570
novel would be tougher for me it's not
my mentality you know so some people I

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:45.899
think they want to make films they make
one you realize um you know maybe that's

00:00:45.899 --> 00:00:50.579
not my medium so it's just finding your
right medium I was lucky to fairly early

00:00:50.579 --> 00:00:54.989
on hit on it that's just the terms I
think in but you know the industry

00:00:54.989 --> 00:01:00.960
changes a lot but the the core mission
of most filmmakers who just tell stories

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:05.600
that are meaningful to them that that
never changes

